# Normalize all text to LF in the repo and working tree. This keeps the generated
# builds byte-identical across platforms so the CI drift check is stable, and keeps
# shell shebangs (install.sh) valid when cloned on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly binary (none today, but future-proof).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
